(card "exp:H-R2-4_c75_sqrt_damp" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R2-4_c75_sqrt_damp"
  :body "---\nnav: 7\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R2-4\nshort_name: c75_sqrt_damp\ntitle: \"H-R2-4 — C7.5 × clip((ratio/median)^0.5, 0.5, 1.5) sqrt-damp\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.3322\ntrain_trade_count: 170\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8941\ntrain_sharpe: 8.0621\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0060\nval_nav_mean: 1.0933\nval_nav_sigma: 0.1051\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4576\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.6548\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0038\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r2, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R2-4 — C7.5 × clip((ratio/median)^0.5, 0.5, 1.5) sqrt-damp\n\n> **TL;DR** —— H-R2 sweep 的\"非线性公式\"档：sqrt damping 把 ratio/median 的偏离开根号压平，再 clip。train NAV 3.33 / test 1.46，与 R2-1 linear (3.43/1.48) 几乎 tie，但 **sharpe 8.06 是 H-R2 最高**。证明 sizing 公式选择是 NAV ↔ sharpe trade-off 的另一个 lever。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- linear `ratio/median` 的扩展性是\"信号越强 size 越线性增加\"；当 ratio/median 远大于 1 时容易撞 clip 上界。\n- sqrt damping = 压制极端偏离：`(ratio/median)^0.5` 把 (1.5, ∞) 区间收敛到 (1.22, 1.5)，单笔 variance 更小，sharpe 更高。\n- 假设：sqrt-damp 应能在不显著降 NAV 的前提下提升 sharpe。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 公式：\n  $$ \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}}},\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right) $$\n- mean_size = 1.114, std_size = 0.240（vs linear 0.352，明显更紧）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median` helper，strict past-only，warmup=10。\n- `#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.3322 | 170 | 8.06 | 89.4% | -0.60% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0933 ± 0.105 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4576 | 31 | 7.65 | 80.6% | -0.38% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.209 | +11 | +0.50 | +5.6pp | +0.15pp |\n| **Δ vs R2-1 (linear, same base)** | -0.023 | 0 | +0.28 | 0 | +0.05pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-1__rolling_30d_median_solo]]\n- **builds on**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C7.5__top3_no_open3min]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-1__c75_linear_sizing]] (同 base 不同公式)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]]\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R2-4)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **sizing functional form 是独立维度**。下次类似 arc 应 sweep [linear, sqrt, log, Kelly-linear (R3b 系列)]，而不是仅 sweep λ 系数。\n- sqrt-damp 在 R3b sweep 里没单独跑（R3b 只 sweep λ on Kelly-linear），是 vault 留下的 gap —— 下次 arc 可以补 \"sqrt-damp + λ\" 二维 sweep。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-4__c75_sqrt_damp.md"
